WEBVTT

00:13:57.945 --> 00:14:00.117
or he would get there
and they would be gone?"

00:14:01.106 --> 00:14:03.147
And so I asked my grandmother once

00:14:03.171 --> 00:14:06.353
why she thought
that he took this journey up,

00:14:06.377 --> 00:14:07.527
and she said,

00:14:08.491 --> 00:14:10.658
"I guess he had to believe
it was possible."

00:14:12.518 --> 00:14:16.066
I have been propelled by possibility
for most of my life.

00:14:17.542 --> 00:14:21.721
I am here because somebody,
starting with my ancestors,

00:14:21.745 --> 00:14:23.454
believed I was possible.

00:14:26.193 --> 00:14:28.827
In 2006, 12 years ago,

00:14:29.789 --> 00:14:34.238
I laid across a mattress on my floor
in my one-bedroom apartment,